  "content": "\n\n<h1>精致字体微调</h1>\n<p>你是否对原版 Minecraft 的默认字体感到厌倦，却又不想换成截然不同的风格？本字体包在大家多年来习以为常的默认字体基础上，加入了一些细微的调整。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>大写字母居中优化</strong>：告别大写字母重心不稳的问题。</li>\n<li><strong>更圆润紧凑的小写字母</strong>：小写字母经过高度调整，并拥有专属的细微优化。</li>\n<li><strong>细节微调</strong>：☆ 其他小改动 ☆</li>\n</ul>\n<p>无论你是想对游戏界面进行轻度翻新，还是寻求些许新意，本字体包都专为喜爱原版风格且注重细微调整的玩家设计。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/subtle-font-tweaks/files/all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-Download-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&labelColor=0D0D0D&color=F16436\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsubtle-font-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-Download-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&labelColor=0D0D0D&color=1AD166\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Uttj34u4PJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Server-blue?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&labelColor=0D0D0D&color=5865f2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>",
